(1554, 40, 'Priyanshu Garg', 'Other', 'Other', 'Other ', '1. Slack Profile Setup: Update your Slack profile with your full name, job title, and a professional profile picture. Set your status to reflect your current work, like “Working on Website Development,” and include your contact details such as email and phone number. Make sure your profile reflects your role within the company.\n\n2. Daily Task Update for Team Lead: To update daily tasks on SF.doaguru.com, log in and go to the Daily Task Section. Enter the task details, including the project, task description, and time spent, then save it. You can also edit or delete tasks as necessary. Let me know if you encounter any issues.\n\n3. Webmail & IMAP Setup for Mayur Sir: Create a webmail account for Mayur Sir, e.g., mayur.sir@doaguru.com, and set it up with IMAP on his laptop. Configure the email client with IMAP settings (IMAP server: imap.doaguru.com, SMTP: smtp.doaguru.com) and ensure it connects properly. Test the connection and finish the setup.\n', '0', '0', 80, 0, '2024-11-12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0),
