(9769, 40, 'Priyanshu Garg', 'DOAGuru', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'I worked on the “Doaguru Letter” project and completed all the tasks exactly as instructed by the HR team. I fixed the PDF functionality, properly adjusted the header and footer, and aligned all the data and content according to the required format.\n\nI also designed the salary slip template in a clean and systematic format so that it can be generated directly without any issues. Additionally, I set up the complete configuration to ensure smooth and efficient generation of the salary slip.\n\nOverall, I have completed all assigned tasks with accuracy and made sure the entire setup works perfectly as required.', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2025-11-25', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
