(9799, 40, 'Priyanshu Garg', 'DOAGuru', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Today, I properly updated the work letter application and made it live on the server.\nAfter that, I received a call from Alright, and I spoke with them. Their server was down, and they needed to change it. I checked their server and informed them about the cost.\n\nI also updated the company systems and MS Office. The server network was down, which I fixed.\n\nI set up the subscription management, updated it, and pushed it to Git. I completed the admin setup, client setup, and subscription setup.\nEmail and WhatsApp setup are still pending and need to be done.\n\nThank you.', '0', '0', 525, 0, '2025-11-26', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
