(11899, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'Learning ', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Explored Redis and understood how to integrate it with Node.js to enhance application performance through efficient data caching, faster data transfer, and optimized storage.\nStudied Socket.IO and learned how it enables real-time communication between the frontend and server, allowing continuous data exchange without losing connection.\nLearned about Redux Toolkit and analyzed how it provides better state management compared to the Context API for handling large-scale application data.\nSuccessfully deployed the Natura Backend Server, ensuring that all APIs are running and functioning correctly in the deployed environment.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-03-16', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
