(11910, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'Natura', 'Development', 'Bug Fixed ', 'Resolved multiple frontend bugs that were impacting deployment, including several minor UI and functional issues.\nFixed backend integration issues encountered while connecting the frontend with the live server.\nSuccessfully deployed the website on the production server.\nConducted a client meeting and presented the live website for review.\nGathered client feedback and identified key requirement changes:\nThe client will show products on the website, but does not own a manufacturing unit.\nProducts are sourced from their associated/child companies or third-party manufacturers.\nThe client operates as a supplier/distributor, handling procurement and supply rather than manufacturing.\nDecided to restructure the website to reflect a service-oriented business model, focusing on:\nProduct sourcing\nSupply chain services\nDistribution\nShared all required information and pending content requirements with the client via WhatsApp group.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-03-17', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
