(12018, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'Natura', 'Development', 'FrontEnd ', 'Task 1: API Configuration and Thumbnail Bug Fix\n\nAll API base URLs in the project were updated from the local development server (http://localhost:5555) to the production server (https://dmcalculator.dentalguru.software) to ensure the application runs correctly in the live environment.\n\nThe \"Thumbnail Creation\" option bug in the calculator was fixed. Previously, this option was hidden for Graphic Services. It has now been corrected and set to default to \"YES\".\n\nFiles Updated:\napp/api/adminApi.js\napp/api/formsApi.js\napp/(pages)/admin/page.jsx\napp/(pages)/admin/login/page.jsx\napp/(pages)/admin/register/page.jsx\ncomponents/AppProviders.jsx\n\nTask 2: Project Cleanup\n\nA full review of the frontend project directory was performed to remove unused files and folders.\n\nThe entire src directory (20+ files) containing an old and unused project structure was deleted. The empty scripts folder was also removed. Additionally, unused root files including data.json, metadata.json, and extensions.txt were deleted. The component ScrollRevealSections.jsx was verified as unused since it was only referenced in the removed src directory.\n\nThis cleanup improved the overall project structure and maintainability.\n\nTask 3: Product Catalogue Enhancement\n\nProduct images were integrated into the Product Catalogue page and the homepage product section to improve visual presentation.\n\nNine product images were added and mapped to their respective products including Cardio Act, Fat Reducer, Madhumaar Kadha, Livo Act, Piloact, Tulsi Adusamrit, Digivin Syrup, and Puro Act.\n\nUpdates were made in utils/utils.js to map product images.\nThe product catalogue page (app/(pages)/products/page.jsx) was updated to display images as product card backgrounds with a fallback icon layout.\nThe homepage (app/(pages)/page.jsx) product section was also updated to show product images.\n\nA custom 404 page was added/updated in app/not-found.jsx.\n\nForm Components Updated:\ncomponents/ContactForms/SupplierRegistration.jsx\ncomponents/ContactForms/ExportQuery.jsx\ncomponents/ContactForms/BusinessPartnership.jsx\ncomponents/ContactForms/GeneralInquiry.jsx\n\nAdditional Update\n\nThe product catalogue file products.pdf was uploaded to public/product/ so users can download the full catalogue from the website.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-03-25', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
