(12024, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Database & Registration Logic\nDatabase Updated: We added the specific fields required to track subscriptions (trial_start_date, trial_end_date, subscription_status) to your clinics table, and a tutorial_completed flag to your users table.\nAutomatic 14-Day Trial: Upgraded the registration flow so that whenever a new clinic registers, the system immediately and automatically activates a 14-day free trial counting exactly from the moment they sign up.\n2. First-Time User Experience (The Tutorial)\nTutorial Page Created: We built a sleek /tutorial page meant solely for the clinic admin\'s first login. It features a placeholder for your upcoming onboarding video and two actions: \"Complete\" or \"Skip for now\".\nMandatory but Skippable: Until the admin clicks one of those two buttons, they are blocked from seeing the dashboard. The backend securely marks the video as completed once they do, ensuring they never see the page again.\n3. Subscription Guards & Dashboard Rules\nImpenetrable Security Layer: Created a \n\nSubscriptionGuard\n that acts as a bouncer for your application. It evaluates a returning user before loading the application:\nRule 1 (Admins): Redirect to the Tutorial if they haven\'t finished it.\nRule 2 (All Staff): Redirect to the Payment/Upgrade page if the 14-day trial has strictly expired.\n4. 10-Day Expiration Warning\nSmart Dashboard Banner: We implemented a dynamic calculation inside the Dashboard. If a clinic is on a trial and has 4 or fewer days remaining (meaning they are past day 10), a prominent yellow banner appears at the very top alerting them: \"Your trial will expire in X days. Please upgrade.\"\n5. Mock Payment / Razorpay Integration\nPayment & Upgrade Page: We built a premium-looking /payment page tailored to your platform. If a user is locked out due to a trial expiration, the only allowable action is checking out.\nDatabase Sync and Restoration: We implemented the backend upgrade logic (/api/auth/upgrade-plan). When a clinic admin successfully \"pays\" (currently running through our animated mock simulation), the system instantly connects to the database, updates the plan from trial to active, synchronizes the local cache, and successfully restores full access to the Dashboard.\n6. Landing Page Connect\nRoute Hookups: Integrated the new flow perfectly with your marketing site by updating the primary button on your Landing Page to definitively point to the /clinic-signup registration flow, jumpstarting the journey.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-03-26', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
