(12297, 72, 'Atul Nema', 'DOAGuru', 'Digital Marketing', 'SEO', 'Daily Work Update – 16 April 2026\nDoon International School – SEO & GMB\nContent & SEO Execution\n1 Blog Created & Published\n“Is Your Child Ready for Boarding School? Signs Parents Should Look For”\nDesigned to target high-intent parent searches related to boarding school admissions\nSuccessfully submitted for indexing via Google Search Console\nWebsite Performance (Latest Insights)\nTotal Clicks: 498 (+17% growth)\nTotal Impressions: 7.05K (+40% growth)\nAverage CTR: 6.2%\nAverage Position: 5.3\n\nHighlight:\n\nHomepage generated 460 clicks, showing strong brand visibility and search demand\nGoogle Business Profile (GMB) Activities\n1 Post Published (Admissions-focused)\n1 Image Uploaded\n1 Video Uploaded\nGMB Performance (April 2026)\nTotal Interactions: 320\nCalls Generated: 76\nChat Clicks: 21\nDirection Requests: 177\nWebsite Clicks: 46\n\nInsight:\n\nHigh direction requests indicate strong local interest and visit intent\nCalls and interactions reflect active parent engagement\nAdditional Work Across Projects\nContent Development\n1 Blog Completed – DOAGuru Infosystems\nFocused on digital marketing / software solutions for business growth\n1 Blog Completed – Jan Jyoti Super Speciality Eye Hospital\nMedical-focused, SEO-optimized content targeting patient awareness\n2 Blogs Completed – IVF Project\nDesigned for fertility awareness, patient education, and lead generation\nClient Meeting & Strategy\nConducted a detailed meeting with Ayushi Construction\nDiscussed website development roadmap\nPlanned SEO optimization strategy\nIdentified structure for improving online presence and lead generation\nOverall Work Summary (Today)\nTotal Blogs Created: 5\nGMB Activities Completed: 3 (Post + Image + Video)\nClient Strategy Meetings: 1\nSEO Performance: Strong growth in visibility and engagement\nFinal Positioning\n\nToday’s execution focused on:\n\nStrengthening search visibility across multiple projects\nExpanding content ecosystem for long-term SEO growth\nEnhancing local engagement and lead signals via GMB\nBuilding new client pipeline through strategy planning\n\nAll activities are aligned toward scaling traffic, improving engagement, and driving measurable business outcomes.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-04-16', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
