(12299, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'FrontEnd ', '1. Global Refactoring and Architecture\n\nCentralizing API Environment Variables (cd41fde)\n\nRemoved hardcoded backend URLs such as localhost from the codebase.\nIntroduced a centralized configuration using .env variables (VITE_API_BASE_URL).\nUpdated the apiBaseUrl.js file accordingly.\nImproved scalability and simplified production deployment.\nChanges impacted approximately 60 files across both Business Developer and Admin modules.\n2. Admin and Business Developer Module Parity\n\nSynchronizing Core Services (ecc9c1a)\n\nRedesigned BD panels (AddService, BDInvoice) to align with Admin panels (ServicesLanding, AdminInvoice).\nAdded the missing DiscountSetting.jsx page.\nIntegrated proper routing via /BD/discount-setting in BDRouter.\nLarge-scale update affecting over 4000 lines of code.\nNo changes were made to backend API contracts.\n\nMirroring UI Updates Across BD Screens (05c2c90)\n\nSynced UI updates across BD modules including BdExplorePlans, ClientDetails, InvoiceCalculation, and SeoServices.\nFixed incorrect navigation links where BD routes were pointing to /admin/... instead of /BD/....\n3. UI Enhancements and Bug Fixes\n\nQuotation Page Layout Changes (9a18dae)\n\nImproved layout and structure for the Create Quotation page.\nUpdated components: Quotation.jsx and ServicesLanding.jsx.\n\nAction Dropdown Behavior Fix (8c709c8)\n\nResolved issue where action dropdown menus remained open after interaction.\nImplemented useRef and useEffect to detect outside clicks and close the dropdown automatically.\nApplied fix in History.jsx and InvoiceHistory.jsx.\n\nInvoice Signature Realignment (7021633)\n\nAdjusted UI to position the invoice signature section on the right side in AdminInvoice.jsx.\nImproved visual consistency of the invoice layout.\nSummary\nFocused on improving code maintainability and scalability through centralized configuration.\nAchieved near-complete parity between Admin and Business Developer modules.\nDelivered multiple UI improvements and resolved key usability issues.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-04-16', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
