(12314, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'FrontEnd ', '1. Mobile & UI/UX Optimization (Priority: High)\nResponsive Overhaul: Dashboard ke components (AdminClientDetails, History Pages) ko desktop-first se shift karke Mobile-friendly (Card-based) banaya gaya hai.\n\nMobile-Specific Elements: Action buttons ke liye Bottom Sheet Popups aur layout-safe Searchable Dropdowns implement kiye gaye hain, jo mobile user experience ko seamless banate hain.\n\nSpacing & Navigation: Layout glitches (scrolling overlap) ko fix kiya gaya aur redundant UI elements (duplicate hamburger menus) ko remove karke code cleanup kiya gaya.\n\n2. Theming & Feature Updates\nGlobal Theme System: ThemeContext aur localStorage ke zariye ek centralized Light/Dark Mode setup kiya gaya. Isse 50 se zyada components ko manage karna asan ho gaya hai.\n\nFunctional Improvements: Quotation aur Calculator pages par Discount UI add kiya gaya hai, jo admin functionality ko user-side (Invoice) ke barabar lata hai.\n\nStructure Reorganization: User settings ko optimize karne ke liye \"Notes\" aur \"Discount Settings\" ko Dashboard Settings Grid mein shift kiya gaya hai.\n\n3. Logic & State Management (Bug Fixes)\nState Persistence: localStorage ke conflict ko resolve karke dashboard tabs ke liye ek unified persistence logic set kiya gaya.\n\nFilter & Pagination Logic:\n\nCalculator notes ka filtration ab real-time aur accurate hai.\n\nPagination index calculations ko fix kiya gaya taaki row numbers galat na ho.\n\nEmpty ya single-page states ke liye pagination controls ko hide karne ka conditional logic lagaya gaya.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-04-17', 'In Progress', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
