(12321, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'new poroject', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '????? Key Achievements Today\n1. Letter System Professionalization\nDynamic Logic: Sabhi letter modules (Offer, PPO, Termination, Relieving) mein Gender-based Pronouns (He/She/His/Her) aur Dynamic Signatory support add kiya.\n\nPreview Parity: Frontend previews aur final generated PDFs ke beech data consistency fix ki.\n\nContextual Fields: Termination letters mein \'Reason for Termination\' aur Salary Slips mein detailed \'Breakdown\' (Basic, HRA, etc.) implement kiya.\n\n2. Full-Scale Download & Listing Architecture\n7 New Listing Pages: Har letter category ke liye dedicated /download/* pages banaye (DownloadInternOfferLetter, DownloadSalarySlip, etc.).\n\nBackend API Rollout: Data persist karne ke liye naye controllers aur mysql2 promise-based routes taiyar kiye.\n\nDatabase Migration: Schema ko production-ready banane ke liye ALTER TABLE scripts run ki aur migrate.js setup kiya.\n\n3. UI/UX & Theme Refinement\nPremium Glassmorphism: Pure dashboard mein Dark Mode ke liye \"Glassmorphism\" UI effect implement kiya.\n\nLight Theme Polish: Light mode mein input visibility aur padding issues fix kiye taaki readability behtar ho sake.\n\nResponsive Forms: Sabhi letter generation forms ko Tailwind CSS ke saath fully responsive banaya.\n\n4. Infrastructure & Security\nEnvironment Config: Sabhi hardcoded API URLs ko .env variables se replace kiya (Production-ready practice).\n\nDB Connection Stability: Local DB connection issues ko fix kiya aur production schema alignment ensure ki.', '0', '0', 600, 0, '2026-04-18', 'In Progress', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0);
