(12399, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Today’s work covered both frontend (client) and backend (server). Main focus areas were fixing invoice calculation issues, restoring backend logic, restructuring the repository, and resolving letterhead generation problems.\n\nKey Work Done\n1. Invoice & Payment Fixes\nFixed incorrect \"Current Balance\" calculation in admin invoices.\nRemoved Ad Budget from balance calculations (kept it informational only).\nCorrected partial payment logic to show accurate remaining balance.\nGST is now determined dynamically using clientData.bill_type.\nImproved print layout by hiding unnecessary fields like \"Previous Amount\".\n2. Backend Fixes & Letterhead\nFixed issues in letterhead generation logic.\nRestored and merged updated server logic.\nUpdated controller and router files to ensure correct API flow.\nAdjusted environment variables for proper backend execution.\n3. Repository Cleanup\nReinitialized Git repository at root level.\nNow both client and server are tracked in a single repo.\nMerged old/unrelated branches into one clean codebase.', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2026-04-30', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
