(12428, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'new poroject', 'Development', 'Back-End', 'Overview\n\nToday’s work focused on fixing calculation issues in the DM Calculator and starting both frontend and backend development for the EWA website.\n\nDM Calculator\nFixed a bug in the Client History ? Invoice Creation flow.\nWhen opening the services preview table inside a quotation, the calculation values were incorrect.\nResolved the issue to ensure accurate service-wise calculations in the preview table.\nEWA Website (Frontend)\nDesigned 2 UI layouts for the website.\nSubmitted both designs for approval.\nEWA Website (Backend)\nCompleted initial backend setup.\nCreated two database tables: User and Staff.\nDeveloped separate authentication APIs for both roles:\nUser Registration API\nUser Login API\nStaff Registration API\nStaff Login API\nSummary\nFixed calculation bug in DM Calculator.\nCreated and submitted UI designs for EWA frontend.\nSet up backend with separate authentication for User and Staff.', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2026-05-02', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
