(12439, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'new poroject', 'Development', 'Back-End', 'Backend Development (EWA Dietitian Consultation Platform)\n? 1. Authentication Module Enhancements\nAdded phone_number field for user and staff registration\nFixed SQL INSERT column/value mismatch issue (registration bug resolved)\nImplemented JWT_SECRET validation before token generation\nStored JWT token in httpOnly cookie for improved security\nRemoved undefined variables (finalRole, type)\nSimplified password validation logic\nImproved admin role handling\n? 2. Client Module Development\nCreated clientcontroller.js\nDeveloped getclient API to fetch user details (ID, name, email, phone, created_at)\nImplemented /api/client/getclient route\nSecured route using role-based middleware (Admin / Receptionist)\n? 3. Plans Module Setup\nCreated planscontroller.js\nInitialized backend structure for plans management\n? 4. Payment Module Development\nDeveloped 4 APIs in paymentController.js:\nAssign plan to user (with duplicate active plan validation)\nFetch current month revenue\nGenerate last 6 months revenue chart data\nRetrieve all payments with user and plan details (JOIN query)\nImplemented payment routes:\n/assign-plan\n/monthly-revenue\n/revenue-chart\n/all-payments\n? 5. Middleware Implementation\nAdded isAdminOrReceptionist middleware for protected routes\nCreated isUser middleware for user-specific access\nStrengthened role-based authentication system\n? 6. Application Configuration & Setup\nUpdated .env configuration (JWT_SECRET)\nFixed dotenv load order issue\nIntegrated Morgan logger for request logging\nRegistered /api/client route in application', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-04', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
