(12446, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '1. Auto-Logout: Implemented a mandatory 15-minute inactivity timer. If a staff member leaves their screen open, the system will automatically log them out and clear sensitive data.\n2. Performance Optimization: Throttled the activity listeners (mouse/keyboard) to update only once every 2 seconds, drastically reducing CPU usage compared to standard timers.\n3. Secure Reveal: Added interactive \"Eye\" icons in the Patient List, Patient Details, and the Receptionist Registration Form. Staff must explicitly click to \"Reveal\" the data, preventing accidental exposure to onlookers.\n4. Protected Forms: In the Receptionist form, the phone number is locked while masked, requiring a \"Reveal\" action before it can be edited, adding an extra layer of protection.\n5. Context-Aware Logs: Every time a patient record is viewed, the system now logs exactly which page it happened on (e.g., \"Doctor Consultation page\" or \"Receptionist Voice Assistant page\").\n6. Database Update: Modified the patient_audit table to support bulk patient IDs, allowing the system to track multiple patients (like in search results) while maintaining a strict audit trail.\n7. Explicit Tracking: Updated the frontend API service to communicate the user\'s location to the backend for 100% accurate logging.', '0', '0', 400, 0, '2026-05-05', '', '', '', 0, '', 0);
