cross projects.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-12', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
(12513, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Conducted detailed research and comparative analysis of NABH-compliant Hospital Management Systems (HMS) to evaluate architecture, scalability, compliance readiness, and implementation feasibility.\nIdentified and analyzed critical issues in Suvarna HMS, including invalid communication workflows and software-level operational limitations affecting reliability and usability.\nResearched and validated callback-based temporal access mechanisms for secure testing and controlled access management within HMS workflows.\nStudied and analyzed Patient Consent Management workflows in alignment with healthcare data handling and compliance requirements.\nAttended HMS implementation and architecture discussion sessions focused on improving system structure, workflow planning, and deployment strategy using modern architecture planning tools.\nPerformed extensive market research on NABH-approved HMS providers and successfully initiated demo request processes with shortlisted vendors for product evaluation.\nConducted comparative evaluation of multiple HMS/EMR platforms including MedWorks, MocDoc, Medical EMR/Management Point, and KareXpert based on modules, compliance support, scalability, and deployment models.\nAnalyzed major HMS operational modules including IPD, OPD, appointment management, and hospital workflow structures to understand implementation requirements and process integration.\nParticipated in multiple HMS product demonstrations and implementation-oriented discussions to understand real-world hospital operational workflows and software deployment requirements.', '0', '0', 504, 0, '2026-05-12', 'In Progress', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
