(12541, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Implemented and enabled Doctor Patient History functionality across multiple sections of the platform to improve consultation workflow efficiency and patient record accessibility. The feature now helps in maintaining and viewing previous patient consultation history, medical context, and treatment-related information in a more structured and accessible manner.\nWorked on integrating patient history visibility within the consultation workflow, allowing consultation records to automatically utilize previously available patient data for better continuity and faster medical review processes. This also included improving pre-filled data handling and consultation preview flow for a smoother doctor-side experience.\nEnhanced patient record management by enabling history-based prefill and preview mechanisms in different modules of the system, helping reduce repetitive manual input and improving overall workflow consistency during consultations and patient record handling.\nPerformed experimentation and testing for running the existing web application inside a translator-supported mobile app environment to evaluate compatibility, accessibility improvements, and cross-platform usability for future deployment possibilities.\nConducted testing and validation of the application behavior within the app-based environment, including UI flow observation, functionality checks, and user experience analysis to understand feasibility for mobile-oriented healthcare workflow usage.', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-05-16', 'In Progress', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
