(12543, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '1. DM Calculator — Code Commits (Git)\nCommit 1 — 25cea1c\n\nFile: client/src/Admin/Quotation.jsx\nQuotation table mein Ads Service ka display simplify kiya\n3 insertions, 11 deletions\n\nCommit 2 — 855efff\n\nFiles: AdminInvoice.jsx, History.jsx, controller.js, getController.js\nyoutube_video_posting ki amount parsing fix ki, fallback support add kiya\nInvoice mein YouTube Video Posting charges sahi se show hone lage\nBackend controller parsing aur response compatibility update ki\n70 insertions, 9 deletions\n\nCommit 3 — b0344b8\n\nFiles: 12 files — Admin, BusinessDeveloper aur Client modules\nPoore project mein Ads service names standardize kiye\nGoogle Ad Management Charges ? Google Ads Campaign Management & Optimization\nMeta Ad Management Charges ? Meta Ads Campaign Management & Optimization\n\"Ad\" ko \"Ads\" mein standardize kiya\ngetServiceDisplayName mapping logic improve ki\nTypo fix: \"Managment\" ? \"Management\"\n160 insertions, 77 deletions\n\n\n2. DM Calculator — Assign Feature Workflow Design\n\nAssign feature ka complete role-based workflow design kiya\n4 roles cover kiye: Admin, Team Lead, Project Owner, Resources\nAdmin ko naya project aate hi WhatsApp aur Email notification jayegi\nEmployee data sw.duaguru.com se fetch hoga, Team Lead identify kiya jayega\nAdmin DM Calculator ke andar Team Lead ko assign karega\nTeam Lead bhi DM Calculator mein login karke Project Owner ko assign karega\nHar assignment level pe remark aur comments ka support rahega\nTask sf.duaguru.com dashboard mein dikhega, notification bhi jayegi\nProject Owner progress update karega jo Admin aur Team Lead dono dekh sakenge\nDeadline ke hisab se reminder tab tak jayega jab tak task Done mark na ho\nDM Team ke liye special monthly calendar flow design kiya:\n\nEmployee select karo, calendar khulega\nDate pe click karo, us date pe services aur quantity assign karo\nSari services assign hone ke baad final Save karo\nHar selected date us service ki deadline manegi\n\n\nFigJam mein Mermaid flowchart diagram bhi banaya\n\n\n3. WordPress — dvjei.org\n\nWebsite: https://dvjei.org\nMission and Vision page banaya aur publish kiya\nPage URL: https://dvjei.org/mission-and-vision/\nPage ko About dropdown menu mein add kiya\n\n\nSummary\nTaskStatusAds Service display simplifiedDoneYouTube Video Posting invoice fixDoneGlobal Ads naming standardization (12 files)DoneAssign Feature workflow designDoneWordPress Mission & Vision pageDone', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-16', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
