(12548, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Task Report – May 18, 2026\nWorked on multiple updates and improvements in the DM Calculator project.\nImproved quotation, invoice, history, and service-related sections.\nFixed several issues and improved the overall user experience and responsiveness of the website.\nUpdated and organized different service names and layouts across the project.\nWorked on invoice calculations and payment-related improvements.\nMade improvements in the admin and client-side workflow.\nEWA Website\nWorked on staff login and access-related improvements.\nUpdated website settings and configurations for smoother functionality.\nHad a meeting with the client to discuss required changes and future updates.\nTook detailed briefing from the client regarding website modifications.\nCreated and shared a reference video of the website with the client for better understanding.\nNATURA Website\nUpdated the website backend connection to the live server.\nRemoved unnecessary local development references.\nReviewed and verified production-related changes.\nAdditional Work\nReviewed repository commits and project progress.\nCoordinated ongoing tasks and planned upcoming fixes and improvements.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-18', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
