(12557, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Back-End', '1. Workflow Architecture & System Design (DM-Calculator × SF Integration)\nDesigned complete project lifecycle for DM-Calculator and its integration with SF portal (sf.doaguru.com). Full flow mapped across 5 phases:\n\nPhase 1 — Quotation Flow: New project auto-assigns to SF Admin with notification. Quotation created by Admin or Manager, sent for Admin approval, then dispatched to client via Email or WhatsApp.\nPhase 2 — Client Response: 4 states handled — Pending, Reject, Changes (reroutes to edit), Approve (moves to invoice). Every client action notifies Admin with SF Dashboard update.\nPhase 3 — Invoice & Team Assignment: Invoice generated and sent to client. Live employee data fetched from SF. Project routed to Team Lead with notification.\nPhase 4 — Strategy & Sign-off: Project Owner prepares Strategy and Work Calendar. Admin approves first, then forwards to client. On client sign-off, status updates across all dashboards. Remarks trackable at every step.\nPhase 5 — Task Scheduling: Assign popup with employee dropdown and calendar. Multiple Task Owners assignable in one session. On save, all stakeholders notified simultaneously. Deadline reminders triggered daily from 4 days before due date.\n\n\n2. API Mapping — DM ? SF\n\nDM ? SF (7 endpoints): New quotation, client quotation approval, invoice sent, strategy submission, client strategy approval, team lead assignment, task assignments\nSF ? DM (3 webhooks): Admin quotation decision, Admin strategy decision, Task Owner status update\n\n\n3. Database Migration\n4 new tables created, quotation_status expanded to 17 workflow states.\nTablePurposeworkflow_strategyStrategy tasks per projectworkflow_task_assignmentsTask-wise assignment with deadlinesworkflow_project_assignmentsTeam and lead assignment recordworkflow_remarksStep-wise remarks log\n\n4. Server Files Written\nFilePurposeworkflowController.js18 functions — full workflow logicsfIntegration.jsAll SF push and fetch callsrouter_additions.js18 new API routes addedmigration.sqlDB schema changes.env updated3 new variables added\n\n5. Status Summary\nTaskStatusWorkflow architecture & API design? CompletedDatabase migration? CompletedServer files written & integrated? CompletedRouter & .env updated? CompletedWebhook URLs to SF team? PendingFrontend changes? Next phase', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-20', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
