(12561, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '1. Environment & Configuration Setup\nEnvironment Variable: .env file mein VITE_SF_BASE_URL configure kiya taaki Salesforce integration ke endpoint ko secure aur dynamic rakha ja sake.\n\nCentralized Config: client/src/config/sfBaseUrl.js file create ki, jo pure application mein base URL ko properly export aur fallback manage karti hai.\n\n2. State Management & Core Workflow Logic (History.jsx)\nWorkflow States: Total 8 naye modal state variables aur 11 workflow data states implement kiye (jaise selectedChannel, workflowRemark, strategyTasks, taskAssignments, etc.) taaki multi-phase approval system ka data track ho sake.\n\nAPI Handlers: Total 12 custom workflow functions write aur integrate kiye, jo niche diye gaye core operations ko handle karte hain:\n\nAdmin Submission (handleSubmitToAdmin)\n\nClient Routing via Email/WhatsApp (handleSendToClient)\n\nClient Decision Logging (handleMarkClientResponse / handleClientStrategyDecision)\n\nStrategy & Task Creation (handleSaveStrategy / fetchStrategy)\n\nSF Team & Employee Fetching (fetchSFTeams / fetchSFTeamLeads)\n\nAllocation Logic (handleAssignTeamLead / handleSaveTaskOwners)\n\n3. Dynamic UI/UX Enhancements\nContextual Actions Dropdown: Purane static menu (Preview, Assign, Approve, Delete) ko replace karke ek smart dynamic dropdown lagaya, jo quotation_status ke hisab se wahi action dikhayega jo us stage par required hai (e.g., pending par sirf \"Submit to Admin\", invoice_sent par \"Make Strategy\").\n\nEnhanced Status Badges: Ek comprehensive status-badge map implement kiya jo 16+ unique workflow states ko alag-alag color-coded badges ke saath dashboard par clear visibility deta hai.\n\n4. Interactive Modals Implementation\n8 New Custom Modals: Pure workflow lifecycle ke liye 8 popups/modals design aur integrate kiye:\n\nSubmit to Admin Modal (with Remarks)\n\nSend to Client Modal (Channel Selector: Email/WhatsApp)\n\nClient Response Matrix Modal (Approve/Reject/Changes)\n\nMake Strategy Modal (Dynamic row builder for tasks)\n\nSend Strategy Modal (Document Preview)\n\nClient Strategy Decision Modal\n\nAssign Team Lead Modal (Live SF Team dropdowns)\n\nAssign Task Owners Modal (Service-wise employee grid assignment)\n\n5. Automation & Code Optimization\nInvoice State Automation: Invoice generate hone ke turant baad invoiceSentNotify API callback trigger kiya, jisse system status manually change karne ki jagah automatically invoice_sent par shift ho jaye.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-21', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
