(12572, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Researched OPD and IPD workflow architecture in HMS systems\nUnderstood complete basic HMS operational flow and module connections\nAnalyzed patient journey from registration to consultation and billing\nExplored real-world hospital workflow management systems\nResearched and identified a demo HMS platform for analysis and comparison\nStudied doctor, receptionist, and admin workflow interactions\nDesigned and tested basic OPD/IPD form structures locally\nCreated demo consultation and patient management flow for testing\nBuilt local testing environment for HMS workflow validation\nWorked on role-based flow understanding for Admin, Doctor, and Receptionist\nExplored appointment, consultation, and patient record handling flow\nTested form structure and data handling process in local environment\nAnalyzed practical HMS implementation approaches and workflow dependencies\nStudied how different HMS modules communicate with each other\nPerformed workflow-level research for future MedBrainix HMS planning', '0', '0', 504, 0, '2026-05-22', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
(12573, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Tasks Completed Today:\nWorkflow Restructuring & Logic Mapping:\n\nDM Calculator aur SF Portal ke core state pipeline ko upgrade kiya.\n\nNaya end-to-end operational sequence finalize kiya: client_approved ? proforma_invoice_generated ? proforma_invoice_sent ? payment_received_invoice_ready ? invoice_sent.\n\nDatabase Schema Design & Migration Script:\n\nNaye workflow states ko support karne ke liye quotation_status table ka ALTER COLUMN ENUM script taiyar kiya.\n\nMultiple aur partial payments track karne ke liye workflow_payment_ledger table ka schema create kiya, jisme data integrity ke liye txn_id, client_id, amount_received, aur reference fields add kiye hain.\n\nReal-time math calculations (Total Contract Value vs Pending Balance) ko fast aur optimize rakhne ke liye database indexes (idx_txn_client, idx_payment_date) implement kiye.\n\nCross-Platform Synchronization Architecture:\n\nBina actual backend APIs ke multi-role dashboards ko aapas mein real-time sync karne ka structure design kiya, jo React Context API aur LocalStorage events par kaam karega.\n\nMaster Lovable Prompt Engineering (Frontend Demo):\n\nStakeholders presentation ke liye Lovable engine par ek premium, production-ready frontend prototype ka master prompt design aur deploy kiya.\n\nIs prototype mein 4 distinct dashboards ko integrate kiya: DM Manager, SF Admin, SF Project Owner, aur SF Task Owner.\n\nPresentation ke dauran data change live dikhane ke liye ek collapsible \"Live Workflow Database JSON Side Panel\" ka UI logic add kiya.\n\nBilling & Layout Logic Standardization:\n\nProforma Invoice generation ke liye existing GST/Non-GST layout structures ko finalize kiya, jisme background mein automatic final invoice trigger hone ka mathematical formula set kiya hai.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-22', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
