(12583, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Today was a highly productive day focused on the development and structuring of the HMS (Hospital Management System).\nWe successfully designed and developed around 58+ tabs/modules in the HMS UI along with forms, workflows, and interconnected management sections. The main focus today was building a scalable and production-like hospital ecosystem interface.\nMajor Modules & Features Worked On:\nDashboard Management\nBilling System\nPatient Appointment Management\nPatient Management\nOPD Module\nIPD Module\nRoom Management\nNurse Module\nDoctor Module\nEMR (Electronic Medical Record) Sheet\nUser Management\nAdministrator Panel\nMedicine Management System\nReport Generation\nUser Profile Management\nDevelopment Progress:\nDesigned and structured complete UI flows for all major HMS modules.\nCreated multiple forms, management pages, navigation systems, and workflows.\nConnected different modules logically to simulate a real HMS ecosystem.\nWorked on scalable architecture planning for future backend integration.\nIntegrated dummy backend/database entries with the help of AI for testing purposes.\nAdded test data into the database to validate flows, UI rendering, and management operations.\nFocused on improving usability, modularity, and future scalability of the system.\nBuilt the foundation for a complete hospital workflow including administration, doctors, nurses, patients, billing, and medical records.\nOverall, today\'s work was heavily focused on building the HMS core structure, expanding the UI ecosystem, and preparing the platform for deeper backend and real-time integrations in upcoming development phases.', '0', '0', 300, 0, '2026-05-23', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
