(12587, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '# Today’s Development Tasks & Progress Update\n\nToday, I successfully developed and enhanced multiple core modules and subscription functionalities for the HMS (Hospital Management System) platform, including major frontend, backend, database, and payment workflow improvements.\n\n## 1. HMS Nurse Module Development\n\nDesigned and developed a complete **Nurse Module** for the HMS system with a structured and scalable workflow.\n\n### Implemented Nurse Dashboard\n\nCreated a dedicated Nurse Dashboard to provide centralized access to operational activities and patient management tools.\n\n### Developed Nurse Module Sub-Tabs\n\nThe following functional tabs were successfully created and integrated inside the Nurse Module:\n\n* Patient Record Intake & Outpatient\n* Nurse Progress Notes\n* Vital Signs Monitoring\n* Bedside Procedures\n* IP Room Transfer\n* Patient History\n* Discharge Summary\n\nThese modules were designed to improve nurse workflow management, patient tracking, and overall operational efficiency inside the HMS ecosystem.\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Profile Management\n\nDeveloped a separate User Profile section with the following functionalities:\n\n* My Profile\n* Edit Profile\n* Change Password\n\nThis improves account personalization and user management capabilities within the platform.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Subscription Auto-Renewal System\n\nEnabled and integrated the Subscription Auto-Renewal functionality for the platform.\n\n### Payment Flow Improvements\n\nEnhanced the signup and subscription workflow by introducing a mandatory payment setup step during registration.\n\n### New Signup Verification Step\n\nAdded a new onboarding step where users must enter their payment/card details before completing registration. Without payment information, account registration is restricted.\n\n### Debit & Credit Card Integration\n\nSuccessfully integrated:\n\n* Debit Card Payments\n* Credit Card Payments\n* Auto Payment Processing\n\ninside the Subscription & Billing section.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Current Pending Enhancement\n\nThe auto-payment system is functioning correctly after activation, however:\n\n* The subscription auto-start process after signup is not fully automated yet.\n* Currently, subscriptions require manual activation after the user enters card details during registration.\n\nThis issue is under implementation and will be automated in the upcoming update cycle.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Technical & System-Level Changes\n\nPerformed multiple architecture-level and infrastructure updates, including:\n\n* Backend Logic Updates\n* Frontend UI/UX Modifications\n* Database Structure Changes\n* Payment Workflow Enhancements\n* Subscription Handling Improvements\n* Additional system optimizations and integrations\n\nOverall, today’s development work significantly improved the HMS platform’s scalability, billing automation workflow, and nurse operation management system.\n', '0', '0', 540, 0, '2026-05-25', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
