(12594, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '???? Task Report - Mock SF Portal & DM Calculator Integration\nGenerated: May 26, 2026\n\nProject: Integration Lifecycle\n\nReport Type: Initial Architecture & Webhook Setup\n\n????? Mock SF (Salesforce) Portal Setup\nExpress.js Server Architecture\n\nInitialized and configured a scalable Express.js backend server to manage routing, middleware integration, and incoming HTTP requests.\n\nMySQL Database Configuration\n\nEstablished a secure connection with the MySQL database using connection pooling to efficiently handle multiple concurrent database queries.\n\nDependency Management & Environment Security\n\nConfigured package.json with essential development packages including express, mysql2, axios (for HTTP requests), cors (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing), and dotenv (for protecting environment variables and sensitive credentials).\n\nRepository Cleanliness (.gitignore)\n\nAdded a .gitignore file to ensure local environment files (.env), system dependencies (node_modules), and logs are excluded from Git tracking.\n\nAdmin Monitoring Dashboard Layout\n\nCreated an internal monitoring frontend under public/index.html to serve as a centralized workspace for tracking portal data.\n\nDashboard Navigation Structure\n\nImplemented a clean navigation layout within the frontend dashboard to allow seamless switching between logs, projects, and task screens.\n\nReal-time Data Rendering\n\nIntegrated REST APIs with the frontend layout to dynamically fetch, display, and render live simulated data and webhook statuses on the UI screen.\n\nDatabase CRUD Layer Logic\n\nWrote core CRUD queries to smoothly read records for the dashboard frontend and log data safely inside the database tables.\n\n???? DM Calculator Integration & Webhook Lifecycle\nQuhook Receiver Endpoint (Quotation)\n\nImplemented a dedicated webhook receiver API to capture, parse, and store complex quotation data payloads transmitted directly from the DM Calculator.\n\nStrategy Webhook Receiver Endpoint\n\nDeveloped a receiving API route to listen for and record strategic marketing layouts and business strategy distributions sent by the calculator system.\n\nProject Webhook Receiver Endpoint\n\nCreated an integration route to catch and update the operational statuses and technical parameters of projects initiated from approved quotations.\n\nTask Assignment Webhook Receiver Endpoint\n\nSet up an API endpoint to listen for real-time task allocations and staff assignments synced from the external system.\n\nAdmin Action Simulation Webhooks (Sender)\n\nBuilt outbound webhook simulation APIs to mimic Admin activities (such as approvals or rejections) and broadcast them back to the DM Calculator.\n\nTask Owner Simulation Webhooks (Sender)\n\nAdded sender endpoints to simulate structural state-changes and updates made by a Task Owner, ensuring the DM Calculator stays informed of task lifecycles.', '0', '0', 580, 0, '2026-05-26', '', '', '', 0, '', 0);
