(12599, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Bug Fixed ', 'Today’s Task Report\n\nDM Workflow Project:\n\n1. Fixed quotation history rendering and admin workflow issues in client/src/Admin/History.jsx.\n2. Improved workflow state rendering and overall admin workflow handling.\n3. Enhanced API response handling using fallback conditions:\n\n   * res.data.success\n   * res.data.status === \"Success\"\n4. Fixed txn_id filtering issues for numeric values.\n5. Resolved empty table and disappearing data issues after the “Submit To Admin” workflow.\n6. Updated quotation_status ENUM with additional workflow states including pending_admin_approval.\n7. Added frontend debug logging for workflow response and txn_id tracking.\n8. Improved workflow handling and WhatsApp-related server-side logic.\n9. Worked on the following backend controller files:\n\n   * server/controller/Workflowcontroller.js\n   * server/controller/Sfintegration.js\n   * server/controller/getController.js\n   * server/controller/sendWhatsApp.js\n10. Created TASK_REPORT.md to maintain project change history and workflow updates.\n11. Improved API response compatibility for handling multiple response formats.\n\nAdvayan Website:\n\n1. Fixed CSS and frontend styling issues across approximately 113 website pages.\n2. Resolved cache-related styling conflicts affecting website responsiveness and layout structure.\n3. Restored proper UI consistency, spacing, responsiveness, and frontend appearance across the website.\n4. Fixed multiple Max Mega Menu plugin issues related to:\n\n   * submenu hierarchy\n   * submenu alignment\n   * hover/click behavior\n   * navigation usability\n5. Improved navigation bar structure, submenu positioning, spacing, and menu interactions.\n6. Converted unstable hover-based submenu behavior into stable click-based navigation.\n7. Improved overall website UI/UX, navigation stability, and frontend performance.\n', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-05-28', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
