(12605, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'DM Workflow / SF Mock System\n\n### Backend Development\n\n* Added workflow.routes.js\n* Added workflow.controller.js\n* Registered workflowRoutes in app.js\n* Added schema.sql\n* Implemented assignTasks controller for task assignment and quotation status updates\n* Implemented notify controller for sf_notifications insertion\n* Updated backend dependencies:\n\n  * express ? ^4.22.2\n  * dotenv ? ^16.6.1\n\n---\n\n## Existing Backend Updates\n\n* Modified action.controller.js\n* Modified action.routes.js\n* Updated app.js for frontend aggregation API support\n\n---\n\n## Frontend Refactor & Cleanup\n\n* Migrated structure from src/componets to src/components\n* Converted TypeScript files to JavaScript/JSX\n* Refactored:\n\n  * AppShell\n  * TopNav\n  * Modal\n  * WorkflowTimeline\n  * ActivityFeed\n  * LiveDatabasePanel\n\n---\n\n## New Frontend Files Added\n\n* AppShell.jsx\n* SFAdminDashboard.jsx\n* ActionModals.jsx\n* WorkflowContext.jsx\n* error-capture.js\n* utils.js\n* workflow.js\n* routeTree.gen.js\n\n---\n\n## Runtime File Migration\n\n* router.tsx ? router.jsx\n* server.ts ? server.js\n* start.ts ? start.js\n* vite.config.ts ? vite.config.js\n\n---\n\n## Cleanup Work\n\n* Removed obsolete TypeScript files\n* Deleted unused legacy UI utility files\n\n---\n\n## Package & Dependency Updates\n\n* Modified package.json\n* Updated package-lock.json\n\n---\n\n## Git Commit Summary\n\n* Commit ID: 354ec3000483a0c97be6c26432bd7f9caec54917\n* Branch: sf-mock\n* 89 files changed\n* 1,250 insertions\n* 6,084 deletions\n\n---\n\n# Advayan WordPress Website Updates\n\n## ServiceNow Page Improvements\n\n* Temporarily disabled the existing ServiceNow page for redesign improvements\n* Improved page styling and layout\n* Updated ServiceNow banner image\n* Updated banner text/content\n* Enhanced UI consistency and overall visual presentation', '0', '0', 580, 0, '2026-05-29', '', '', '',