(12617, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'AI Doctor Assist', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Today\'s HMS progress involved a major backend and frontend module integration effort across multiple hospital management workflows.\n\nOn the backend, I designed, created, and connected several new controllers to establish a scalable architecture for core HMS operations. This included Appointment Management, Authentication & Access Control, Billing Management, Dashboard Analytics, IPD (In-Patient Department) Operations, Medicine Management, and Nursing Workflow Controllers. Each controller was structured and integrated to ensure smooth communication between business logic and APIs.\n\nI also developed and connected dedicated route layers for various HMS modules, including Appointments, Authentication, Billing, Dashboard, Departments, Doctors, and other related services. This significantly improved the application\'s modularity, maintainability, and overall routing structure.\n\nOn the frontend, I created and integrated multiple functional pages covering major HMS operations such as Dashboard, Appointments, Billing, Departments, and IPD Management. Additionally, I worked on specialized nursing workflow screens, including Bedside Management, Discharge Processing, and Intake/Output Monitoring, ensuring proper connectivity with backend services and data flow.\n\nA major part of today\'s work was focused on validating end-to-end connectivity between modules, verifying internal routing, testing navigation flows, and ensuring seamless integration between frontend pages, backend APIs, controllers, and route handlers.\n\nOverall, today\'s contribution laid a strong foundation for several critical HMS modules by establishing the core architecture, integrating workflows, and ensuring that all newly developed components are properly connected and functioning as part of a unified Hospital Management System.\n', '0', '0', 300, 0, '2026-06-01', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
(12618, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Task Report – sf-mock (Today\'s Work)\nCommits Covered\n1. 78f01e2\nAdded TaskOwnerDashboard.jsx\nCreated task management & employee assignment UI\nAdded task owner workflow support\n2. 6a7b4d5\nEnhanced workflow status handling\nAdded strategy_status tracking\nImproved workflow timeline UI\nAdded client_id support in DM webhook calls\nImproved strategy workflow mapping & error handling\nDM Workflow\nQuotation ? Invoice ? Strategy Flow\nSubmit Quotation to Admin\nSend Quotation to Client\nMark Client Response\nGenerate Proforma Invoice\nSend Proforma Invoice\nRecord Payment\nSend Final Invoice\nCreate Strategy\nFeatures Added\nRetry functionality\nEmail / WhatsApp / Both sending options\nLive payment summary & pending amount\nStatus badges\nConditional action dropdowns\nServices preview before invoice generation\nImproved workflow timeline\nSF Workflow\nTeam & Task Assignment Flow\nStrategy Approved\nAssign Team Lead\nAssign Task Owners\nTasks move to SF execution flow\nSF Integration\nTeam fetching\nTeam Lead selection\nEmployee assignment\nclient_id passed in webhook calls\nUI Components / Modals Added\nSubmit Admin Modal\nSend Client Modal\nClient Response Modal\nProforma Invoice Modal\nPayment Modal\nFinal Invoice Modal\nStrategy Modal\nTeam Lead Modal\nTask Owners Modal', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-06-01', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
