(12629, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'FrontEnd ', 'Task Report - Invoice Module Improvements & Bug Fixes\n\n1. Invoice Print & Amount Calculation Improvements\n\n* Fixed issue where \"Previous Amount\" was hidden during invoice print/PDF generation.\n* Removed unnecessary print:hidden behavior from Previous Amount section.\n* Added new \"Grand Total\" row after Previous Amount in invoice summary.\n* Implemented Grand Total calculation:\n  Grand Total = Invoice Total + Previous Amount\n* Verified GST summary calculations:\n\n  * Taxable Amount\n  * CGST @9%\n  * SGST @9%\n  * Invoice Total\n  * Previous Amount\n  * Final Grand Total\n* Reviewed and traced complete previous_amt and current_amt invoice carry-forward logic across invoice flow.\n* Analyzed outstanding balance handling for partial payments and invoice-to-invoice carry forwarding.\n\n2. Invoice Print Layout & UI Fixes\n\n* Fixed invoice print layout overflow issue causing lower summary data to get clipped.\n* Updated invoice wrapper height handling for better print compatibility.\n* Fixed print visibility behavior for summary amount sections.\n* Hidden unnecessary yellow \"Discount\" action button from print/PDF view using print:hidden.\n\n3. Invoice Calculation Module Enhancements\n\n* Fixed edit functionality behavior in InvoiceCalculation module.\n* Added automatic smooth scroll-to-top behavior when clicking edit/pencil button.\n* Improved user experience while editing invoice entries.\n\n4. Delete Functionality Fixes\n\n* Fixed non-working delete (\"X\") button issue in InvoiceCalculation module.\n* Implemented missing handleDelete functionality.\n* Added confirmation popup before deleting invoice entries.\n* Added success/error handling for deletion actions.\n* Synced delete behavior with InvoiceCustomise module logic.\n* Corrected API endpoint usage:\n\n  * Replaced incorrect deleteGraphicEntryById endpoint\n  * Updated to use deleteInvoiceById endpoint for consistency.\n\n5. Additional Validation & Logic Review\n\n* Reviewed invoice summary calculations for GST and outstanding balances.\n* Validated current balance and received amount logic.\n* Verified backend data dependency for previous outstanding amount handling.\n* Reviewed invoice print rendering and action visibility conditions.\n', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-06-03', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
