(12651, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'DOAGURU', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Hospital Campaign \n\n**Campaign Project Update**\n\nCampaign project ka frontend development successfully complete kar diya hai.\n\nCompleted Modules:\n• Dashboard page completed\n• Create Campaign main page completed\n• Reporting module completed\n• Settings module completed\n\nCreate Campaign section mein dynamic form/link generation functionality implement kar di gayi hai.\n\nReporting module mein:\n• Separate campaign cards added\n• Product campaigns listing completed\n• Campaign reports export functionality implemented\n\nSettings section ki UI aur required configurations bhi complete kar di gayi hain.\n\nAb project frontend side se functional hai aur next phase ke liye ready hai.\n', '0', '0', 360, 0, '2026-06-08', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
(12652, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Bug Fixed ', 'Bug Fixes\n1. Removed Discount Button from Additional Service\n\nOn the Admin Invoice page, a discount button was appearing with the Additional Service amount, which was not required. The unnecessary discount button has been removed.\n\n2. Fixed Add-on Values Not Updating During Edit\n\nWhile editing calculator entries, changes made to Thumbnail Creation and Meta Growth (Content Posting) add-ons were not updating correctly and old values were being retained. This issue has been resolved, and add-on values now update properly.\n\n3. Fixed Entry Update Failure on Service/Category Change\n\nWhen editing an entry, changing the service or category caused the update process to fail and data was not being saved correctly. The issue has been fixed, and all modified fields now save successfully.\n\nUpdates / Improvements\n1. Added Smooth Scroll to Form on Edit Button Click\n\nPreviously, when the Edit button was clicked from the table, the input form was not immediately visible to the user. Now, the page automatically performs a smooth scroll to the form section for a better user experience.\n\nThis improvement has been implemented in both:\n\nAdmin Calculator\nBusiness Developer Calculator', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-06-08', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
