(12662, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'new poroject', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '1. Admin Reviews Dropdown Fix\nAdmin Reviews page me duplicate business names show ho rahe the.\nIs issue ko fix kiya gaya.\nAb dropdown me har business ka naam sirf ek baar show hota hai.\nSame business ke sabhi reviews ab properly ek saath filter hote hain.\n2. Mobile Testing & Network Issue Fix\nMobile par local network se project open karne par API properly work nahi kar rahi thi.\nIs network issue ko fix kiya gaya.\nAb mobile aur other devices par local IP se project smoothly access ho raha hai.\nAPI aur database data ab correctly fetch ho raha hai.\n3. AI Review Quality Improvement\nAI-generated reviews ki language aur tone improve ki gayi.\nReviews ko zyada professional aur natural banaya gaya.\nHindi reviews me unnecessary translation issue fix kiya gaya.\nReview cut hone ka issue bhi resolve kiya gaya.\nRepetitive words ko replace karke better sentence quality di gayi.\n4. Fallback Review Improvement\nInternet ya AI API fail hone par generic review show ho raha tha.\nFallback reviews ko improve kiya gaya.\nAb fallback reviews me bhi selected services aur keywords properly show hote hain.\nOffline ya API issue ke time bhi personalized review generate hota hai.\n5. Backend Data Handling Improvements\nKeywords handling aur parsing related issues fix kiye gaye.\nDifferent formats me save data ko properly manage karne ka logic improve kiya gaya.\nEnvironment configuration ko standardize kiya gaya.\nQR-related URL handling bhi update ki gayi.\nOverall Work Summary\nAdmin panel filtering improve ki gayi.\nMobile testing aur local network issues resolve kiye gaye.\nAI review generation ko zyada professional aur user-friendly banaya gaya.\nFallback review system ko enhance kiya gaya.\nBackend data handling aur configuration ko optimize kiya gaya.', '0', '0', 480, 0, '2026-06-10', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
