(12680, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'new poroject', 'Development', 'Back-End', 'Project: GMB Review Management System\n\nTasks Completed\n1. Review Generation API Improvements\nIncreased AI API timeout from 6 seconds to 25 seconds to support production server latency.\nAdded proper timeout and abort request handling.\nImplemented clear timeout responses instead of silently returning fallback reviews.\n2. Controller Stability Enhancements\nAdded safe JSON parsing using try...catch blocks to prevent server crashes caused by invalid data.\nImproved pagination parameter handling and controller reliability.\nApplied consistent code formatting and cleanup.\n3. Admin & Client Management Updates\nEnhanced profile, review, status, and subscription management controllers.\nImproved request handling and data processing across admin and client APIs.\n4. Repository Maintenance\nRemoved outdated files and unnecessary build artifacts.\nImproved project structure and code maintainability.\n5. Merge Conflict Resolution\nSuccessfully merged backend and controller updates while preserving existing functionality.\nOutcome\n\nImproved review generation reliability, strengthened backend error handling, enhanced API stability, and ensured a cleaner and more maintainable codebase.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-06-11', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
