(12710, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'HMS', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '1. Add Future Visit Feature\nImplement functionality to schedule future patient visits.\nAllow users to select a future date and time.\nLink future visits with patient records.\nDisplay upcoming visits in the patient profile and relevant dashboards.\n2. Add Advanced Filtering on Patient Directory\nImplement filtering options for:\nPatient Name\nIP Number\nAge\nAddress\nDate\nStart Date\nEnd Date\nGoal: Enable quick and efficient patient record retrieval.\n3. Add Search Functionality in Sidebar\nAdd a global sidebar search.\nAllow searching for modules, menus, and navigation items.\nImprove accessibility and navigation speed.\n4. OPD Consultation Improvements\nRegistration\nAuto-select Department based on configuration.\nAuto-select Incharge/Doctor.\nAdd Reference field.\nAdd Schedule Visit functionality.\n5. Room Profile Update\nUpdate room profile management.\nImprove room details editing.\nEnsure room information remains synchronized across the system.\n6. Add Floor Management\nCreate floor management module.\nSupport multiple floors.\nAssociate rooms with respective floors.\nImprove hospital infrastructure organization.\n7. Create New Room Category Form\nBuild a form to create new room categories.\nFields may include:\nCategory Name\nDescription\nCharges\nStatus\nEnable category management from admin panel.\n8. Discharge Summary Module\nComplete discharge summary workflow.\nAdd patient discharge details.\nInclude diagnosis, treatment, medications, and follow-up instructions.\nGenerate printable discharge summary.\n9. Admin Patient Filtering (OPD & IPD)\nAllow admin users to filter patients by:\nID Number\nPatient Name\nDoctor\nDate\nCustom Date Range\nApplicable to both:\nOPD Patients\nIPD Patients\n10. Recently Given Medicines Module\nAdd medicine history filtering options:\nDate\nPatient Name\nRoute\nMedicine Name\nOther relevant parameters\n11. Add Update Feature in Medicine Chart Tab\nAllow editing existing medicine chart entries.\nSupport updating dosage, timing, frequency, and remarks.\nMaintain audit/history tracking if applicable.\n12. Add Watch Functionality in I/O (Input & Output) Tab\nAdd monitoring/watch feature in Input & Output section.\nImprove tracking of patient fluid intake and output.\nEnable quick review and updates by nursing staff.', '0', '0', 373, 0, '2026-06-15', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
