(12725, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '# Task Report: Proposal Builder Enhancements & Proposal Workflow Improvements\n\n## Overview\n\nEnhanced the Proposal Management System by improving the Proposal Builder architecture, introducing a modular pricing engine, structured cover page management, advanced discount handling, PDF generation improvements, and integrated proposal payment/proforma management within the workflow.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Modular Pricing Builder Implementation\n\n### New Component\n\n**File:** `ProposalPricingBuilder.jsx`\n\n### Enhancements\n\n* Extracted pricing table functionality from the large `ProposalBuilder` component into a dedicated reusable module.\n* Implemented dynamic line item management including:\n\n  * Add item\n  * Edit item\n  * Delete item\n* Added support for:\n\n  * Percentage-based discounts\n  * Flat amount discounts\n* Implemented automatic calculation of:\n\n  * Subtotal\n  * Discount amount\n  * Grand Total\n* Integrated billable item filtering using the pricing calculation helper to ensure only active service items contribute to final pricing.\n\n### Benefits\n\n* Improved maintainability and scalability.\n* Reduced complexity inside Proposal Builder.\n* Simplified future pricing feature enhancements.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Structured Cover Page & Proposal Content Standardization\n\n### Files Updated\n\n* `ProposalBuilder.jsx`\n* `ProposalBuilderBD.jsx`\n\n### Enhancements\n\n* Replaced free-text cover page content with structured fields:\n\n  * Proposal Date\n  * Project Duration\n  * Proposal Validity\n  * Prepared By\n  * Website\n* Added migration support for legacy proposal records to automatically convert older cover page formats into structured JSON-based data.\n* Consolidated:\n\n  * Notes\n  * Terms & Conditions\n    into a single unified section (`combined_notes_tc`) for easier management and cleaner PDF rendering.\n\n### Benefits\n\n* Improved proposal consistency.\n* Better data structure for future automation.\n* Simplified proposal editing and maintenance.\n\n---\n\n## 3. PDF Generation Improvements\n\n### File Updated\n\n* `proposalController.js`\n\n### Enhancements\n\n* Updated PDF generation engine to fully respect front-end visibility toggles.\n* Improved structured cover page rendering.\n* Removed layout inconsistencies and formatting issues.\n* Added support for combined Notes & Terms section.\n* Improved section rendering logic to avoid duplicate content blocks.\n* Enhanced overall PDF presentation and readability.\n\n### Verification\n\n* PDF generation tested successfully.\n* Structured cover page displayed correctly.\n* Notes and Terms rendered as expected.\n* No duplicate sections generated.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Proposal Payment & Proforma Workflow Integration\n\n### File Updated\n\n* `History.jsx`\n\n### Enhancements\n\n* Integrated `ProformaManagerModal` directly into Proposal History.\n* Enabled proposal payment and proforma management without leaving the history screen.\n* Simplified workflow navigation for Admin users.\n* Removed obsolete standalone pages:\n\n  * `ProposalPayments.jsx`\n  * `ProposalPaymentsBD.jsx`\n\n### Benefits\n\n* Improved user experience.\n* Reduced workflow complexity.\n* Centralized proposal management operations.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Proposal Workflow Architecture Improvements\n\n### Workflow Refinement\n\nImplemented and aligned the proposal lifecycle with the new business process:\n\n```text\nProposal\n   ?\nProforma Invoice\n   ?\nPayment Recording\n   ?\nPayment Verification\n   ?\nInvoice Generation\n```\n\n### Key Improvements\n\n* Proposal remains the single source of truth.\n* Enhanced proposal-to-proforma relationship handling.\n* Improved payment tracking workflow.\n* Better separation between proposal, payment, and invoicing stages.\n* Maintained backward compatibility with legacy proposal data.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Testing & Validation\n\n### Functional Validation\n\n* Verified dynamic pricing calculations.\n* Verified percentage and flat discount calculations.\n* Verified proposal save and update operations.\n* Verified legacy proposal migration.\n* Verified PDF generation output.\n* Verified payment and proforma modal integration.\n* Verified backward compatibility with existing records.\n\n### Result\n\nAll implemented enhancements are functioning correctly with successful end-to-end validation across proposal creation, pricing, PDF generation, and payment workflow management.\n', '0', '0', 550, 0, '2026-06-17', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
