(12761, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', '# Development Task Report (Today)\n\nHere is a detailed breakdown of all the enhancements, fixes, and features that were successfully implemented today across the application.\n\n## 1. Ads Services rendering & Calculations \n- **Replication of Ads Services UI**: Replicated the dedicated \"Ads Services\" table inside `AdminInvoice.jsx` so that it flawlessly matches the highly-requested format previously present only in `Quotation.jsx`.\n- **Dynamic Taxes Calculation**: The Ads Services section correctly applies a strict **18% GST** on ad budgets dynamically regardless of whether the overarching invoice has GST enabled or disabled.\n- **Totals Calculation Adjustments**: Included nested and previously unaccounted parameters (such as YouTube Video Posting totals) correctly in the final \"DM Service Total\", ensuring perfect parity between the calculated invoice breakdown and the final Grand Total.\n\n## 2. TDS Integration in Payment Systems\n- **New TDS Recording Modal**: Upgraded the `ProformaManagerModal.jsx` payment modal. Whenever a payment is recorded, the user can now mark if TDS is applicable and specify the deduction percentage (`tds_percentage`).\n- **Live Outstanding Summaries**: Added an interactive bottom bar in the payment modal that calculates and visualizes the `Outstanding Balance`, `Settle Amount`, and `Pending Balance` live as the user enters the payment and checks TDS.\n\n## 3. Comprehensive Payment History in Invoices\n- **Invoice Display Enhancements**: Upgraded `AdminInvoice.jsx` to show a professional \"Payment History\" table.\n- **TDS and Reference Rendering**: If payments were made with TDS deductions, the history table gracefully shows the exact `? TDS Amount` and the percentage. It also shows dates, modes (e.g., UPI, Net Banking), and `Transaction Reference` codes.\n- **Grand Total Summaries**: Appended clean breakdowns of \"TDS Deducted\" and \"Received Amounts\" directly under the main Grand Total in the final printable invoice area.\n\n## 4. Proforma to Quotation Component Migration\n- **Admin Routing Upgrades**: Rewired the system so that `doc=proforma` generation opens smoothly inside the cleaner `Quotation.jsx` layout instead of the standard `AdminInvoice.jsx`, ensuring Proformas have distinct visual handling.\n- **Business Developer Consistency**: Replicated the same logic in `HistoryBD.jsx` and `QuotationBD.jsx` ensuring that the Business Developer portals stay in strict sync with Admin-level changes.\n- **Data Fetching Consistency**: Overhauled `Quotation.jsx` to seamlessly fetch live proposal data and Proforma records (from the `proposal` and `proforma` tables) when a Proforma URL flag is present.\n\n## 5. Deletions and Safety Safeguards\n- **Deletion Warnings**: In `History.jsx`, added dedicated \"Delete Proforma\" and \"View Proforma\" buttons. Triggering a deletion now produces a severe warning, advising the user that connected payment records will also be irreversibly destroyed.\n- **Backend Cleanups**: Successfully patched the backend schemas to execute cascading deletions across `proposal_payment_records` whenever its parent Proforma gets deleted.\n\n## 6. Proforma Generation & Discount Fixes\n- **Service Name Formatting**: Hardcoded renaming scripts into `utils/proformaPricing.js` to automatically sanitize \"Ads Campaign Management\" to display as cleaner standard \"Service Charges\".\n- **Cross-Component Discount Sync**: Proposal discounts are now globally synchronized and reliably fetched between the Proforma Manager (`History.jsx`) and the Invoice builder modals (`Quotationmode.jsx`).\n- **Database Consistency Fixes**: Stabilized `base_amount` and `total_amount` columns in the backend Proforma records so they don\'t corrupt when GST applicability toggles are changed rapidly at generation time.\n', '0', '0', 600, 0, '2026-06-20', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
