(12772, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'DOAGURU', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'API Stability aur Backward Compatibility (Frontend)\nProblem: Live backend endpoint par jab tak pagination implement nahi hota, frontend direct flat array ([...]) receive karne par empty screen/error show kar raha tha.\nSolution: Sabhi download letter modules ke andar dual checking logic integrate kiya:\nAgar backend paginated format ({ data, totalPages, totalItems }) return karta hai, to ye direct use consume karega.\nAgar backend simple array ([...]) return karta hai, to frontend automatically client-side slice logic lagakar use page array mein break kar dega, taaki pagination UI button continue work karte rahein aur data hide na ho.\nFiles updated:\nDownloadExperienceLetter.jsx\nDownloadInternExperienceLetter.jsx\nDownloadInternOfferLetter.jsx\nDownloadInternPPOLetter.jsx\nDownloadOfferLetter.jsx\nDownloadRelievingLetter.jsx\nDownloadSalarySlip.jsx\nDownloadTerminationLetter.jsx\n2. Direct DB Deletion Utility (Employee Experience Letter)\nBackend Changes:\nServer/Controller/LetterDownloadController.js ke andar deleteExperienceLetter query wrapper function banaya jo database ki experincel table se specific records remove karta hai.\nServer/Routes/routes.js ke andar DELETE /api/experience-letters/:id endpoint expose kiya.\nFrontend Changes:\nDownloadExperienceLetter.jsx table component mein har list item ke actions column mein Delete Button (Trash Icon) add kiya.\nButton click par user warning alert dialogue (window.confirm) push kiya aur successfully status delete hone ke baad automated table refresh functionality hook ki.\n3. Config aur Build checks\nClient/.env ke andhar VITE_API_BASE_URL wapas live api target (https://letters.siarasystems.com) par link kiya.\nReact application compile check kiya (npm run build), build bina kisi error ke successfully compile ho chuka hai!', '0', '0', 405, 0, '2026-06-22', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
