(12878, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'ye mera aj ka kam tha \n\n# Daily Task Report: DM-Calculator Updates\n\n**Date**: June 29, 2026  \n**Project**: DM-Calculator (SaaS Dashboard & Financial System)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Payment Recording & Invoice Logic Fixes\n**Issue Identified:** Partial payments were incorrectly setting the Proforma status to \"Paid\", and subsequent payments were failing to record in the database due to a premature termination in the code.\n**Actions Taken:**\n*   **Code Refactoring:** Overhauled the `recordProposalPayment` function in `proposalController.js`.\n*   **Logic Correction:** Removed the premature `return` statement that was blocking consecutive partial payments from being inserted into the `proposal_payment_records` table.\n*   **Invoice Duplication Fix:** Adjusted the conditional logic to prevent the system from generating a duplicate invoice when a payment is made on a Proforma that already has an existing invoice.\n*   **Database Correction:** Executed a manual SQL script to correct the status of Proforma #36 from `paid` to `partially_paid`.\n\n## 2. Revenue History Dashboard Development\n**Issue Identified:** The Revenue History tab was a \"Coming Soon\" placeholder and needed a live data feed showing global financial metrics.\n**Actions Taken:**\n*   **Backend API Creation:** \n    *   Developed the `getRevenueHistory` endpoint in `proposalController.js`.\n    *   Implemented logic to fetch all invoices and accurately calculate the global `Total Received`, `Total Pending`, and `Total Amount`.\n    *   Exposed the API via a new authenticated route: `GET /auth/api/calculator/revenue/history`.\n*   **Frontend UI Design (Stitch MCP):** \n    *   Generated a premium, high-fidelity React component (`RevenueHistory.jsx`) using a dark-glassmorphic design language (\"Obsidian Architect\").\n    *   Implemented three main executive metric cards with neon gradients and a detailed data table for individual invoices.\n*   **Frontend Integration:** \n    *   Wired up the new component in `HistoryHub.jsx`, effectively replacing the placeholder.\n    *   Integrated live API fetching using `axios` with Indian Rupee (INR) currency formatting.\n\n## 3. UI/UX Bug Fixes & Refinements\n**Actions Taken:**\n*   **Authentication Fix:** Resolved a `401 Unauthorized` error on the new Revenue page by switching from `localStorage` token retrieval to the secure Redux global state (`useSelector`).\n*   **Build Optimization:** Fixed a Vite compiler crash by identifying and removing an unused, uninstalled dependency (`date-fns`).\n*   **Icon Rendering:** Fixed broken Material Design icons (\"payments\" and \"hourglass_empty\" rendering as plain text) by replacing them with matching SVG icons (`Banknote`, `Hourglass`) from the existing `lucide-react` library.\n\n---\n\n### Pending / Next Steps\n*   Ensure the complimentary service calculation discrepancies between Proformas and Invoices are fully resolved (as discussed earlier in the session).\n*   Expand the Proforma History tab functionality to include the \"Record Payment\" workflow directly from the grid.\n\n\niske alawa mene \nstyle: improve About page hero visibility and update brand assets to Siara Properties\n\n- Adjusted hero section background gradients in AboutPageNew to enhance text legibility without washing out the background image.\n- Increased font-weights and optimized text colors for titles and subtitles in the hero section for better contrast.\n- Replaced all outdated \"BharatRoofers\" text mentions, emails, and social media links with \"Siara Properties\" across About pages and Footer components.\n- Imported `react-icons/fa` and replaced plain text social placeholders (fb, insta, yt, wa) with actual SVG icons in the updated Footer.\n- Fixed minor spacing and formatting issues in JSX files.\n\nye bhi kiya he \niski ek detaild structure vice task report banao \nno emoji \nonli heading and detaild para graph \nno technicality ', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-06-29', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
