(12944, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'new poroject', 'Development', 'FrontEnd ', 'Aapke aaj ke saare kamaal ke kaamon ko ek professional aur clean format mein organize kar diya hai. Ise aap apne paas track rakhne ke liye ya client/team ke sath share karne ke liye use kar sakte hain:\n\n---\n\n# **DAILY TASK REPORT**\n\n**Date:** July 4, 2026\n\n**Developer:** Ashish\n\n**Status:** Productive Day / Key Milestones Achieved\n\n---\n\n## ## 1. DM-Calculator (Invoice & PDF Module)\n\n* **Invoice UI Optimization:**\n* Code se redundant **\"Ads Services\" table block ko remove kiya**.\n* Redundancy khatam hone se invoice clean ho gaya aur print/download ke waqt space optimize ho gayi.\n\n\n* **Client-Side PDF R&D & Debugging:**\n* Pehle `html2pdf.js` ke sath client-side rendering test ki, jisme canvas limitations ke chalte multi-page invoice ka layout aur table headers break ho rahe the.\n* Ek temporary fallback lagaya jo user ko native browser print settings (`Save as PDF`) ke sath download karne ka alert deta hai.\n\n\n* **Full-Stack Server-Side PDF Implementation (Final Solution):**\n* `AdminInvoice.jsx` frontend code mein missing `async/await` syntax errors ko trace karke fix kiya.\n* Backend file **`genratecoatetion.js`** ke architecture ka use karke **Puppeteer (Headless Browser) engine** setup kiya.\n\n\n* Frontend se full HTML payload lekar backend par background mein flawless A4 PDF (with 0 margins & background graphics) generate karwayi.\n* API se aane wale PDF blob ko dynamically response se read karke single-click par **direct download feature** complete kiya aur clean Git commit ke sath push kiya.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## ## 2. SiraPropertys (Bug Fixes & Live Deployment)\n\n* **Critical Bug Fix (Image URL Resolution):**\n* Controller mein hardcoded `http://localhost/` base URL ka issue tha, jisse live environment par property images load nahi ho rahi thin.\n* URL logic ko dynamic/correct live path se replace karke images breaking ka issue permanently solve kiya.\n\n\n* **Blog Module Fixes:**\n* New blog add karte waqt aa rahe crashes aur validation errors ko debug aur resolve kiya.\n\n\n* **Live Deployment:**\n* Poore project ko successfully live server par deploy kiya. Dono modules fully functional hain:\n* **Client Panel:** Jahan normal users properties browse kar sakte hain aur dynamic enquiry drop kar sakte hain.\n* **Admin Dashboard:** Jahan se property management (Add/Delete/Image Updates), blogs aur user analytics/visits ko track kiya ja sakta hai.\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n## ## 3. HMS (Hospital Management System - Eye Clinic R&D)\n\n* **Market Research & Workflow Mapping:**\n* Eye Clinic module ko core HMS ke sath integrate karne se pehle workflow ko samajhne ke liye competitors aur existing systems par appointments book kiye.\n* Ek platform se live software demo liya taaki eye-specific requirements (jaise vision charts, prescriptions, aur doctor-patient workflow) ka ek solid blueprint banaya ja sake.\n\n\n\n---\n\n### ### Summary of Impact\n\n> Aaj ke tasks se **SiraPropertys** ka main phase live ho chuka hai, **DM-Calculator** mein bina kisi layout distortion ke direct PDF download ho raha hai, aur **HMS** ke agle bade feature (Eye Clinic) ki core requirement gathering puri ho chuki hai.', '0', '0', 500, 0, '2026-07-04', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
