(13018, 120, 'Mohd Qaisar Moin', 'campaign', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Campaign - APP\n\nAadhaar Card OCR Scanner (Tesseract & Sharp) ????????\nImage Improvement (Sharp): Background backend par Sharp library ka use karke Aadhaar image ko automatically grayscale kiya jata hai, normalize kiya jata hai, aur 3x upscale kiya jata hai taaki text extraction clear ho sake.\nText Extraction (Tesseract): Tesseract.js engine se image me se saara text extract kiya jata hai.\nRules & Regex Parsing: Kuch predefined code rules aur Regex ke zariye extracted text me se Aadhaar Number, Name, DOB, Gender, aur Address details nikaal kar form ko automatically fill kiya jata hai.\n\nDynamic Form Builder (Custom Question Fields) ?????????\nFlexible Fields: Admin forms me apni marzi ke inputs select kar sakta hai (jaise: Single/Multi-line text, Number, Date, Checkbox, Dropdowns, Aadhaar scanner integration, Photo capture, aur Signature pad).\nDrag-and-Drop Order: Fields ko aage-piche shift kiya ja sakta hai aur unhe mandatory (required) mark kiya ja sakta hai.\n4. Custom SVG Charts Dashboard ????????\nZero-Bloat Charts: Bina kisi heavy chart library ke, app performance ko fast rakhne ke liye react-native-svg ka use karke custom Bar, Line aur Donut charts manually draw kiye gaye hain.\nStats Feed: Total Campaigns, Active Campaigns, aur Daily registrations trends ke stats dynamic dashboards par show hote hain.\n5. Central Audit Registry (Entries Screen) ????????\nSearch & Filters: Sabhi submissions ki list jahan registration ID, participant name, aur status (Approved/Pending/Rejected) ke filters laga kar records check kiye ja sakte hain.\nDetail Modal: Kisi entry par click karte hi uske answers, uploaded documents, aur signature ki details open ho jati hain.', '0', '0', 340, 0, '2026-07-09', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
