(13027, 119, 'Ashish Dubey ', 'DM Calculator', 'Development', 'Front-end and Back-end ', 'Ran command: `git log --since=\"midnight\" --pretty=format:\"%h - %s%n%b\"`\n\n**Daily Task Report**\n\n**Invoice UI and Complimentary Services Enhancement**\n- Implemented a complimentary badge for services priced at ?0 in both Admin and Business Developer invoices.\n- Rendered conditional UI styling (strikethrough on the original price with a green badge) across Graphic Services and Additional Services table loops.\n- Fixed calculation bugs in array reduction functions by applying fallback numerical values, ensuring that zero-priced items do not cause NaN errors in the final invoice totals.\n\n**Ad Budget Payment Tracking and Validation**\n- Developed a calculation logic to accurately track the remaining ad budget by deducting past realized ad budget payments from the overall proforma budget.\n- Enhanced the ProformaManagerModal interface to dynamically display the exact remaining ad budget and automatically hide input options if the budget is fully paid.\n- Added strict frontend validation preventing users from inputting a realized ad budget that exceeds the remaining limit.\n- Disabled the payment submission button dynamically when validation fails to block accidental overpayments.\n\n**PDF Generation and Server Crash Resolutions**\n- Fixed a bug where the realized ad budget was undefined by updating the proposal controller queries to sum approved payments properly from the database.\n- Resolved server crashes during PDF generation by eliminating disk input/output operations inside temporary folders, which were triggering automatic server restarts.\n- Prevented silent application hangs during PDF creation by modifying Puppeteer network wait conditions and implementing a timeout.\n- Optimized the download process by streaming the generated PDF buffer directly to the client instead of writing it to the disk.\n\n**Networking, Messaging, and Payload Optimization**\n- Fixed the MySQL packet-too-large error by adding zlib compression for saving heavy JSON snapshots to the database and decompressing them upon retrieval.\n- Resolved IPv6 routing timeouts that were crashing NodeMailer and Axios requests by enforcing IPv4 resolution globally on the Node server.\n- Fixed WhatsApp Meta API rejection errors by updating the hardcoded backend template names to precisely match the approved templates in the Meta dashboard.\n- Updated the success modal in the proposal actions component to explicitly list successful delivery channels, improving visibility for Email and WhatsApp notifications.\n\n**Public Invoice Access and Revenue Dashboard Addition**\n- Resolved access denied errors on public invoice links by correcting a database table name typo in the public controller query.\n- Fixed a session expiration redirection bug for public invoice links by properly blocking protected API calls when public mode is active.\n- Prevented a UI crash during public invoice rendering by mapping the flat data arrays into the correct state structure before rendering.\n- Implemented a new backend route to extract and calculate total TDS amounts from invoices.\n- Added a new \"Total TDS\" summary card in the revenue history dashboard and adjusted the layout grid to accommodate it cleanly.\n\n**Data Formatting and System Stability**\n- Fixed the \"Amount-In-Words\" generation bug across invoices by applying a mathematical fallback before converting numbers to text strings.\n- Restored functionality in the quotation mode to properly capture and apply custom duration start and end dates on generated proforma invoices.\n- Resolved database connection reset errors by stabilizing the backend database pool handling.', '0', '0', 600, 0, '2026-07-09', '', '', '', 0, '', 0),
